  "description": "Qifan.ZPLConverter是跨平台类库，可以整合进 .NET Framework、.NET CORE等项目，将 ZPL（斑马编程语言）命令转换为图像或PDF文件，如 PNG、JPG、WBMP、GIF或PDF。\n-----------------------------------------------------\nQifan.ZPLConverter is a cross-platform library that can be integrated into projects such as .NET Framework and .NET CORE, converting ZPL (Zebra Programming Language) commands into image or PDF files, such as PNG, JPG, WBMP, GIF, or PDF.",
